lib3mf
------------------------------------------
Lib3MF is a C++ implementation of the 3D Manufacturing Format file standard.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  lib3mf-devel-2.5.0-1bl1
  lib3mf2-2.5.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzip-devel-1.5.1-1
  libzip5-1.5.1-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  fast_float-8.3.3-1bl1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libzip-devel-1.5.1-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/3MFConsortium/lib3mf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/3MFConsortium/lib3mf/archive/v2.5.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack lib3mf-2.5.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./lib3mf-2.5.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/lib3mf-2.5.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lib3mf-2.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lib3mf2-2.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/lib3mf-devel-2.5.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

